{"title": "LG WebOS Moderno (ThinQ AI)", "parent": "tv_lg", "description": "Veja como instalar os aplicativos recomendados diretamente na loja oficial da sua LG (Modelos 2018+).", "content": {"type": "text", "data": "<div class='space-y-10 animate-fadeIn'><div class='bg-emerald-600/10 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-tv'></i> Sistema WebOS Atualizado</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>Sua TV possui suporte total aos melhores aplicativos da nossa rede. Siga os passos abaixo para instalar.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/40'>1</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-blue-500/30 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl group hover:bg-[#252b36] transition-all'><div class='flex items-center gap-4 mb-4'><div class='w-16 h-16 bg-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 border border-gray-800 group-hover:bg-blue-600 transition-all shrink-0'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-toptv.png' class='w-full h-full object-contain' onerror=\"this.src='/shared_assets/logo/icone.avif'\"></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight'>TOPTV App</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-blue-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest'>Recomendação Oficial</p></div></div><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4'>O player oficial da nossa rede. Gratuito, rápido e com suporte a todos os conteúdos. Pesquise por <strong class='text-white'>'TOPTV'</strong> ou <strong class='text-white'>'HD PLAYER'</strong> na loja da TV.</p></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-indigo-900/40'>2</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl group hover:bg-[#252b36] transition-all'><div class='flex items-center gap-4 mb-4'><div class='w-16 h-16 bg-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 border border-gray-800 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 transition-all shrink-0'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-hd-player.png' class='w-full h-full object-contain'></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight'>HD Player</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-indigo-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest'>Interface Premium</p></div></div><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed'>Visual moderno estilo Netflix. Ideal para Smart TVs de alta performance. Também é <b>totalmente gratuito</b>. Busque por <strong class='text-white'>'HD Player'</strong> na loja da sua LG.</p></div></section><div class='bg-blue-600 p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-blue-900/20 mb-10'><h4 class='text-white font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-2'>🚀 Já instalou?</h4><p class='text-white/80 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-6'>No HD Player, você precisará de um <b>Código de Provedor</b>. Utilize o código principal abaixo:</p><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-blue-500/30 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-xl'><p class='text-[8px] text-blue-400 font-black uppercase mb-1'>Código Principal</p><h2 class='text-2xl font-black text-white'>4100</h2></div><button onclick=\"navigateTo('manual_hd_player', 'Manual HD Player')\" class='w-full mt-4 bg-white text-blue-600 font-black py-3 rounded-2xl text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-blue-50 transition-all shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-book-open'></i> Ver Todos os Códigos</button></div><section class='relative pl-12 mt-8'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-purple-900/40'>3</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl group hover:bg-[#252b36] transition-all'><div class='flex items-center gap-4 mb-4'><div class='w-16 h-16 bg-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 border border-gray-800 group-hover:bg-purple-600 transition-all shrink-0'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-flexplay.jpg' class='w-full h-full object-contain rounded-xl'></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight'>Flexplay</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-purple-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest'>Nova Opção Moderna</p></div></div><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Aplicativo extremamente rápido e moderno. Assim como o HD Player, também é gratuito e funciona com os mesmos <b>Códigos de Provedor (ex: 4100)</b>. Pesquise por <strong class='text-white'>'FLEXPLAY'</strong> na loja.</p><button onclick=\"navigateTo('app_flexplay', 'Manual Flexplay')\" class='w-full bg-white/5 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/20 font-black py-3 rounded-2xl text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-purple-500 hover:text-white transition-all shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-book-open'></i> Ver Manual do Flexplay</button></div></section><section class='relative pl-12 mt-8'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-emerald-900/40'>4</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl group hover:bg-[#252b36] transition-all'><div class='flex items-center gap-4 mb-4'><div class='w-16 h-16 bg-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 border border-gray-800 group-hover:bg-emerald-600 transition-all shrink-0'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-brasil-iptv.jpg' class='w-full h-full object-contain rounded-xl'></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight'>Brasil IPTV</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest'>Nova Opção Nativa</p></div></div><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Excelente alternativa nativa. Também é gratuito e funciona com os mesmos <b>Códigos de Provedor (ex: 4100)</b>. Pesquise por <strong class='text-white'>'BRASIL IPTV'</strong> na loja.</p><button onclick=\"navigateTo('app_brasil_iptv', 'Manual Brasil IPTV')\" class='w-full bg-white/5 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 font-black py-3 rounded-2xl text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-emerald-500 hover:text-white transition-all shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-book-open'></i> Ver Manual Brasil IPTV</button></div></section><section class='relative pl-12 mt-8'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-amber-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-amber-900/40'>5</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl group hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all'><div class='flex items-center gap-4 mb-4'><div class='w-16 h-16 bg-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 border border-gray-800 group-hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all shrink-0'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-clouddy.webp' class='w-full h-full object-contain'></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight'>ClouDDy</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-amber-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest'>Estabilidade Máxima</p></div></div><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4'>O player mais estável do mercado. Indicado para usuários que buscam o máximo em performance.</p><div class='bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 p-4 rounded-2xl'><p class='text-[9px] text-amber-200 font-bold uppercase mb-1'><i class='fas fa-info-circle'></i> Nota Importante:</p><p class='text-[9px] text-gray-400'>Este aplicativo é pago à parte diretamente ao desenvolvedor. Oferece 7 dias de teste gratuito.</p></div></div></section><div class='mt-12 space-y-6'><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-widest border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4'>Aulas em Vídeo para este Modelo</h4><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4'><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl'><div class='aspect-video bg-black'><video controls class='w-full h-full'><source src='/shared_assets/videos_tutoriais/aparelhos/lg-criar-conta-webos.mp4' type='video/mp4'></video></div><div class='p-4 text-center'><p class='text-[10px] font-black text-white uppercase'>Como criar conta na LG</p></div></div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl'><div class='aspect-video bg-black'><video controls class='w-full h-full'><source src='/shared_assets/videos_tutoriais/aparelhos/reset-lg-webos.mp4' type='video/mp4'></video></div><div class='p-4 text-center'><p class='text-[10px] font-black text-white uppercase'>Como resetar a sua LG</p></div></div></div></div><div class='bg-amber-600/10 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mt-10'><div class='flex items-center gap-4'><div class='w-12 h-12 bg-amber-600/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-amber-500 shrink-0'><i class='fas fa-triangle-exclamation'></i></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-widest'>Problemas com a loja?</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1'>Se por algum motivo você não conseguir instalar os apps, utilize o método de <b>Configuração via DNS</b>.</p></div></div><button onclick=\"navigateTo('dns', 'Configuração via DNS')\" class='w-full mt-6 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black py-4 rounded-2xl text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-amber-500 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-amber-900/20'>Ver Passo a Passo do DNS</button></div></div>"}}